A '''character of the day''' (often abbreviated as a '''COD''' or '''CotD''', and also referred to as '''character of the week'''; Japanese: '''ゲストキャラ''' lit. ''guest character'') is an unofficial term referring to a [[List of animated series characters|character in the Pokémon animated series]] who appears in only one episode and is often, but not always, relatively unimportant to the series. While they are usually a [[human]], this label may also be given to a {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}. Note that [[Gym Leader]]s, [[Frontier Brain]]s, [[Elite Four]] members, or other characters that originate from the games (such as [[Bill]]) are not considered as characters of the day, even if they had appeared in one episode only.

